  "prefLabel": "Plc 2103.02 Location of ADR Sessions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2103.02 Location of ADR Sessions. ADR sessions shall be conducted at a neutral location, such as the OPLC offices, or at another location that is more convenient for the participants that all participants agree to use.\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
